   * To request access to this API:
   *
   * 1. Go to your partner dashboard and click **Apps**.
   *
   * 2. Select the app you need to request access for.
   *
   * 3. Click **API access**.
   *
   * 4. Under **Access force data refresh**, click **Request access**.
